# Two-coupon collector
# Source: Tail Probabilities for Randomized Program Runtimes via Martingales for Higher Moments (2019), Appendix E, Listing 1.1, PDF pp.34-35
# URL: https://arxiv.org/pdf/1811.06779v2
# Independently normalized pseudocode; NOT a native input file for any baseline tool.
# C is a ghost counter: one increment per loop-body execution; not CFG runtime.

c0 := 0;
c1 := 0;
C := 0;
while c0 + c1 < 2 do
    C := C + 1;
    if prob(0.5) then
        c0 := 1
    else
        c1 := 1
    fi
od
